      "writtenOn": "2024-08-27T00:10:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a user-hidden `Stub_contributing_api` property introduced with aosp/3235808, which are set for stub submodules generated by the `java_sdk_library` to indicate the api surface the module contributes to. However, even with this property I\u0027m afraid that not all usages of `is_stubs_module` can be replaced with `Stub_contributing_api` property, given that not all stubs contribute to a specific api surface. (e.g. stubs generated by aidl_interface, etc).",
      "parentUuid": "13333047_071c56a7",
